{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AMENTIA is a hand-drawn roguelite action rpg with deckbuilding mechanics. You have been chosen to fight the dark magic of the mages responsable for the chaos. Will you be able to survive the waves of assaults from strange creatures to bring back peace in this world\u2026 and in your mind? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651620/extras/11133bb69c0d1a55fa3c21ff3f1aff83.avif?t=1771231959\" alt=\"Amentia\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651620/extras_big/11133bb69c0d1a55fa3c21ff3f1aff83.webp?t=1771231959 width=1560 height=159 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Once, all living beings, animals and plants, were connected to the magic that permeated the world. But the fragile balance between order and chaos  shattered  corrupting minds and tainting magic with madness. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In this devastated world, a few individuals still resist madness and fight against chaos.  Using ancient knowledge, construct your deck of magic cards to survive hordes of enemies and try to defeat bringers of chaos.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651620/extras/9ca74d2c4a9627e2434d24fb4daae62d.avif?t=1771231959\" alt=\"Battle against hordes of ennemies\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651620/extras_big/9ca74d2c4a9627e2434d24fb4daae62d.webp?t=1771231959 width=1560 height=159 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To fulfill your mission you will have to face hordes of ennemies dramatically increasing in number from waves to waves. Various objectives will present themself along the way allowing you to increase your skills and gain power before confronting the mages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651620/extras/a31aa1e809908dbe2e7d23fb46f3ce64.avif?t=1771231959\" alt=\"Build your deck\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651620/extras_big/a31aa1e809908dbe2e7d23fb46f3ce64.webp?t=1771231959 width=1560 height=159 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect magical cards and build a powerful deck against your ennemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Beware</i> : the magic is tainted with darkness, you will have to use it wisely or you\u2019ll learn it the hard way! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each card will give you a unique magic power with a specific number of use and the cost to pay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651620/extras/b963d550c71eac8970a37445271003cd.avif?t=1771231959\" alt=\"Take on missions and quest\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651620/extras_big/b963d550c71eac8970a37445271003cd.webp?t=1771231959 width=1560 height=159 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run will give you the opportunity to improve your skills and gain special cards by taking part in small missions and quests. You may have to complete a specific objectif or overcome unexpected events. Be attentive to whom you encounter.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651620/extras/fa0a968b4e20d2408fddf00650f8697f.avif?t=1771231959\" alt=\"Meta-progression\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651620/extras_big/fa0a968b4e20d2408fddf00650f8697f.webp?t=1771231959 width=1560 height=159 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be able to upgrade your  abilities with a meta-progression system allowing you to customize your playstyle. Personalize the experience for each character, it might improve your chances of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651620/extras/c1cf5d345867e7bedbba81fd7459197a.avif?t=1771231959\" alt=\"Choose your gameplay\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651620/extras_big/c1cf5d345867e7bedbba81fd7459197a.webp?t=1771231959 width=1560 height=159 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting with the alchemist, you will be able to unlock different characters trapped like you in this world of madness. They all have their own playstyle and unique cards!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels of difficulties will be unlock after completing successfully your mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have the possibility to choose when you play your cards in order to unleash powerful combos or to have a more casual experience by using the \u00ab automatic mode \u00bb. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651620/extras/d38f4c26a8284730f2384ff2df2d40f5.avif?t=1771231959\" alt=\"\"width=1600 height=382 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3651620?t=1771231959","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651620/46c19bfde00a5cd237e7743b9cbe016516e04903/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771231959","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651620/38f03b3da3a1d0584c82715186a68af60a00203b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771231959","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651620/38f03b3da3a1d0584c82715186a68af60a00203b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771231959","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AMENTIA is a hand-drawn roguelite action rpg with deckbuilding mechanics. You have been chosen to fight the dark magic of the mages responsable for the chaos. Will you be able to survive the waves of assaults from strange creatures to bring back peace in this world\u2026 and in your mind? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651620/extras/11133bb69c0d1a55fa3c21ff3f1aff83.avif?t=1771231959\" alt=\"Amentia\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651620/extras_big/11133bb69c0d1a55fa3c21ff3f1aff83.webp?t=1771231959 width=1560 height=159 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Once, all living beings, animals and plants, were connected to the magic that permeated the world. But the fragile balance between order and chaos  shattered  corrupting minds and tainting magic with madness. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In this devastated world, a few individuals still resist madness and fight against chaos.  Using ancient knowledge, construct your deck of magic cards to survive hordes of enemies and try to defeat bringers of chaos.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651620/extras/9ca74d2c4a9627e2434d24fb4daae62d.avif?t=1771231959\" alt=\"Battle against hordes of ennemies\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651620/extras_big/9ca74d2c4a9627e2434d24fb4daae62d.webp?t=1771231959 width=1560 height=159 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To fulfill your mission you will have to face hordes of ennemies dramatically increasing in number from waves to waves. Various objectives will present themself along the way allowing you to increase your skills and gain power before confronting the mages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651620/extras/a31aa1e809908dbe2e7d23fb46f3ce64.avif?t=1771231959\" alt=\"Build your deck\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651620/extras_big/a31aa1e809908dbe2e7d23fb46f3ce64.webp?t=1771231959 width=1560 height=159 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect magical cards and build a powerful deck against your ennemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Beware</i> : the magic is tainted with darkness, you will have to use it wisely or you\u2019ll learn it the hard way! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each card will give you a unique magic power with a specific number of use and the cost to pay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651620/extras/b963d550c71eac8970a37445271003cd.avif?t=1771231959\" alt=\"Take on missions and quest\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651620/extras_big/b963d550c71eac8970a37445271003cd.webp?t=1771231959 width=1560 height=159 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run will give you the opportunity to improve your skills and gain special cards by taking part in small missions and quests. You may have to complete a specific objectif or overcome unexpected events. Be attentive to whom you encounter.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651620/extras/fa0a968b4e20d2408fddf00650f8697f.avif?t=1771231959\" alt=\"Meta-progression\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651620/extras_big/fa0a968b4e20d2408fddf00650f8697f.webp?t=1771231959 width=1560 height=159 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be able to upgrade your  abilities with a meta-progression system allowing you to customize your playstyle. Personalize the experience for each character, it might improve your chances of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651620/extras/c1cf5d345867e7bedbba81fd7459197a.avif?t=1771231959\" alt=\"Choose your gameplay\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651620/extras_big/c1cf5d345867e7bedbba81fd7459197a.webp?t=1771231959 width=1560 height=159 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting with the alchemist, you will be able to unlock different characters trapped like you in this world of madness. They all have their own playstyle and unique cards!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels of difficulties will be unlock after completing successfully your mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have the possibility to choose when you play your cards in order to unleash powerful combos or to have a more casual experience by using the \u00ab automatic mode \u00bb. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651620/extras/d38f4c26a8284730f2384ff2df2d40f5.avif?t=1771231959\" alt=\"\"width=1600 height=382 /></span></p>","developers":["Monstigri"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651620/b136cb0d3f9b079d62ba20feaf281c4dc5c84dcb/header.jpg?t=1771231959","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.0.4<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i5 4590<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD GCN+, NVIDIA Kepler+ with 1go VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> recommended</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3651620/880508/425f19e1b763fb18b5b60fb3d4436ac4fb410f3e/1750414070/dash_av1.mpd?t=1745952127","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3651620/880508/425f19e1b763fb18b5b60fb3d4436ac4fb410f3e/1750414070/dash_h264.mpd?t=1745952127","highlight":